{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And he went not, etc.</b> To meet sorceries, because he knew they would be of no avail, as explained above. Rather, he intended to bless them, and the Holy One, blessed be He, concurred through him, as it is said: ותהי עליו רוח אלהים. Alternatively, he wanted to curse them, but the Shekhinah rested upon him and forced him against his will to bless them."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:10:03.941583088Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}